    """The boundary record at segment number ``index`` when the
    proof directly carries that segment, or the genesis boundary
    (``None``) when ``index`` is 0. For any other segment the proof
    rotated away (it only remembers an aggregate prefix digest) the
    exact boundary cannot be reconstructed, so ``None`` is returned
    rather than guessing."""
